# KANJI-CODE : UTF-8
# Control Line (EIA-485) Information File
# =========================================================
# Column:Content
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# 01:EIA-485 Line Number (1-10)
# 02:Inplementation/Unimplementation (0or1)
# 03:Protocol Name (MAX 12 Charactor)
# 04:Device Type (0:None, 1:Serial Type, 2:TCP Type)
# 05:Device Name or IP Address (MAX 20 Charactor)
# 06:Prot Number (0:Serial type, xxxxx:TCP Port Number)
# 07:Baudrate (Serial Speed)
# 08:Datasize (7or8)
# 09:Parity (0:None, 1:ODD, 2:EVEN)
# 10:Stopbit (1or2)
# 11:Receive Timer (msec)
# 12:Send Interval Timer (msec)
# 13:Cycle Timer (sec)
# =========================================================
